00:07:19.805 --> 00:07:20.638
- Yeah.

00:07:20.638 --> 00:07:21.471
- What got you into cosplay?

00:07:21.471 --> 00:07:22.304
- Me or her?

00:07:22.304 --> 00:07:23.137
- You.

00:07:23.137 --> 00:07:25.488
- Me. Um, I've always been
super into like video games,

00:07:25.488 --> 00:07:27.172
and I'm starting to get more into anime,

00:07:27.172 --> 00:07:30.300
and so it just seemed like
a fun natural thing to do

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:32.379
to start dressing up as the characters

00:07:32.379 --> 00:07:33.641
that I like so much. And it's so fun.

00:07:33.641 --> 00:07:34.474
(bell rings)

00:07:34.474 --> 00:07:35.307
(woosh)

00:07:35.307 --> 00:07:36.341
(click)

00:07:36.341 --> 00:07:37.571
(click)

00:07:37.571 --> 00:07:41.220
- I felt like she was
insistent on ending the round,

00:07:41.220 --> 00:07:44.430
and I still wasn't quite ready to end.

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:46.340
(click)

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:47.701
(click)

00:07:47.701 --> 00:07:50.738
- I don't know, I just,
I felt bad choosing her.

00:07:50.738 --> 00:07:51.611
(click)

00:07:51.611 --> 00:07:52.911
(upbeat music)

00:07:52.911 --> 00:07:54.620
- [Interviewer] Turns out it's a tie.

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:55.990
- Oh god, oh lord.

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:56.823
(dramatic music)

00:07:56.823 --> 00:08:00.521
- [Interviewer] The tie is
between Ai and Samantha.

00:08:00.521 --> 00:08:01.354
- Ooh.

00:08:02.347 --> 00:08:03.508
- [Interviewer] I'm gonna give each of you

00:08:03.508 --> 00:08:05.853
30 seconds to state your case

00:08:05.853 --> 00:08:07.658
of why you're not the mole.

00:08:07.658 --> 00:08:09.810
- I'm from Indonesia and I came here

00:08:09.810 --> 00:08:11.379
about like few years ago.

00:08:11.379 --> 00:08:12.419
I don't know what to say.

00:08:12.419 --> 00:08:15.280
My worst con crunch was
when I did Harley Quinn

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:18.379
and then I did this
character from "Azur Lane"

00:08:18.379 --> 00:08:19.779
and I was like crying
cause all of a sudden

00:08:19.779 --> 00:08:21.910
my sewing machine like
broke down and everything.

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:23.776
Ended up having to drop one of them

00:08:23.776 --> 00:08:26.002
because I didn't end up
finishing the cosplay.

00:08:26.002 --> 00:08:28.072
So I cried a lot that night but. Yeah.

00:08:28.072 --> 00:08:29.491
(laughter)

00:08:29.491 --> 00:08:31.839
- Um, I guess I'll start
with my worst con crunch,

00:08:31.839 --> 00:08:34.041
um it was actually this cosplay.

00:08:34.041 --> 00:08:35.572
I was definitely painting the shoes,

00:08:35.572 --> 00:08:37.281
putting like my finishing
touches on the lines,

00:08:37.281 --> 00:08:38.971
in the car, on the way.

00:08:38.971 --> 00:08:42.296
And I'm like drive faster
um, but it was fine.

00:08:42.296 --> 00:08:44.389
I've been cosplaying for
only about three years.

00:08:44.389 --> 00:08:46.899
I'm still kind of learning
how to get a little bit

00:08:46.899 --> 00:08:48.772
better at my craftsmanship, um.

00:08:48.772 --> 00:08:50.948
It's been a fun journey so far.

00:08:50.948 --> 00:08:51.781
(chuckles)

00:08:51.781 --> 00:08:52.848
(woosh)

00:08:52.848 --> 00:08:54.250
- I feel like AI was official.

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:55.270
The only thing I'm worried about

00:08:55.270 --> 00:08:56.772
is maybe she might be, like,

00:08:56.772 --> 00:08:58.522
a commissioner or something like that.

00:08:58.522 --> 00:08:59.355
- Oh, okay I see.

00:08:59.355 --> 00:09:00.188
- But that's the only thing,

00:09:00.188 --> 00:09:01.054
like she might be the one fabricating it.

00:09:01.054 --> 00:09:01.887
- Oh I see.

00:09:01.887 --> 00:09:03.070
- Samantha's kinda like, newer.

00:09:03.070 --> 00:09:04.951
You know, I never want
to like, gate keep that.

00:09:04.951 --> 00:09:05.839
- [Amber] Oh, yeah.

00:09:05.839 --> 00:09:06.962
- So I'm always worried, like
maybe she might not know.

00:09:06.962 --> 00:09:07.795
- [Amber] Same.

00:09:07.795 --> 00:09:09.400
- She also makes her own things too.

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:10.233
- Yeah exactly.

00:09:10.233 --> 00:09:11.066
- So it's like...

00:09:11.066 --> 00:09:12.080
- But then again she was
saying that she was making it.

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:13.261
Was she making it here?

00:09:13.261 --> 00:09:15.202
Because then she might have
just tried to get it here.

00:09:15.202 --> 00:09:16.961
And I don't know if she
does like other modeling.

00:09:16.961 --> 00:09:17.812
- There's more to talk about.

00:09:17.812 --> 00:09:18.829
I feel like AI had a
lot she wanted to say.

00:09:18.829 --> 00:09:19.779
- Yeah.

00:09:19.779 --> 00:09:20.987
Ooh I feel so bad.

00:09:20.987 --> 00:09:21.820
(laughter)

00:09:21.820 --> 00:09:22.900
(woosh)

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:25.521
- [Interviewer] And the
person who is eliminated is...

00:09:25.521 --> 00:09:28.171
(buzzer)

00:09:28.171 --> 00:09:29.004
- Sorry.

00:09:29.004 --> 00:09:30.411
- Bye guys, it's okay. Good luck.

00:09:30.411 --> 00:09:31.244
- You look so pretty.

00:09:31.244 --> 00:09:32.260
- Thank you.

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:33.099
(laughter)

00:09:33.099 --> 00:09:34.362
- You look really good.

00:09:34.362 --> 00:09:35.230
(woosh)

00:09:35.230 --> 00:09:38.050
- [Interviewer] If you think
the mole is still in the box,

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:39.241
and you wish to continue playing the game,

00:09:39.241 --> 00:09:41.158
please raise your hand.

00:09:43.081 --> 00:09:44.132
- I trust you guys, right?

00:09:44.132 --> 00:09:44.965
(laughter)

00:09:44.965 --> 00:09:46.358
- I feel so bad already
eliminating Samantha.

00:09:46.358 --> 00:09:47.371
- Yeah, I feel like we should have

00:09:47.371 --> 00:09:48.941
just not done the last round.

00:09:48.941 --> 00:09:49.774
- I know.

00:09:49.774 --> 00:09:50.761
Oh my gosh.

00:09:50.761 --> 00:09:52.482
- [Interviewer] If the lights turn red,

00:09:52.482 --> 00:09:54.351
that means the mole is still in the box,

00:09:54.351 --> 00:09:55.921
and you lose.

00:09:55.921 --> 00:09:57.550
If the lights turn green,

00:09:57.550 --> 00:09:59.030
that means you have voted the mole out,

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:00.107
and you win.

00:10:00.107 --> 00:10:02.857
(dramatic music)

00:10:07.158 --> 00:10:10.328
(girls cheering)

00:10:10.328 --> 00:10:13.310
(laughter)

00:10:13.310 --> 00:10:14.611
- Okay, so who was it?

00:10:14.611 --> 00:10:15.499
(woosh)

00:10:15.499 --> 00:10:17.380
- [Interviewer] Will the mole
please reveal themselves.

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:19.963
(upbeat music)

00:10:21.539 --> 00:10:22.630
(woosh)

00:10:22.630 --> 00:10:23.463
(contestants cheering)

00:10:23.463 --> 00:10:24.851
- I knew it, I knew it!

00:10:24.851 --> 00:10:26.949
I knew it, I knew it.

00:10:26.949 --> 00:10:28.269
- I know, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

00:10:28.269 --> 00:10:29.451
- I knew it, I already knew!

00:10:29.451 --> 00:10:30.760
- Anybody who has cosplayed long enough

00:10:30.760 --> 00:10:32.571
would never want to walk
around in those heels

00:10:32.571 --> 00:10:34.191
for an entire convention day.

00:10:34.191 --> 00:10:36.231
- So like, did you just buy this for this?

00:10:36.231 --> 00:10:37.401
- How what, how do you know?

00:10:37.401 --> 00:10:40.251
- I wore for Halloween
like five years ago,

00:10:40.251 --> 00:10:41.310
and I did not have these shoes.

00:10:41.310 --> 00:10:42.508
I did just make these shoes,

00:10:42.508 --> 00:10:43.773
con crunched 'em right before I came here.

00:10:43.773 --> 00:10:44.606
- Yeah!

00:10:44.606 --> 00:10:45.439
- There you go.

00:10:45.439 --> 00:10:46.422
- I sniffed right through that.

00:10:46.422 --> 00:10:47.580
My spidey-senses, it was a spider sense.

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:48.805
I can tell you right
now that's what it was.

00:10:48.805 --> 00:10:50.500
- There's a lot of work that goes into

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:52.720
cosplay that even with all of my research

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:55.228
on the topic I really never
would have known about.

00:10:55.228 --> 00:10:57.533
- I was one of the people
who would put together online

00:10:57.533 --> 00:10:59.018
groups where we would all get together,

00:10:59.018 --> 00:11:00.199
take big group photos,

00:11:00.199 --> 00:11:02.261
and it was a great way
to like, meet people

00:11:02.261 --> 00:11:03.970
that were like minded and like loved

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:05.532
and obsessed the same thing's that I did.

00:11:05.532 --> 00:11:06.380
- We're all nerds.

00:11:06.380 --> 00:11:07.779
We're all just geeking out.

00:11:07.779 --> 00:11:09.941
- You could be a doctor, you
could be in the military,

00:11:09.941 --> 00:11:11.061
you could be a firefighter.

00:11:11.061 --> 00:11:13.522
You meet a cosplayer anywhere.

00:11:13.522 --> 00:11:15.061
- When you can go to a place where you

00:11:15.061 --> 00:11:16.817
can immediately jump into something

00:11:16.817 --> 00:11:18.480
you are very, very into.

00:11:18.480 --> 00:11:19.629
Have you seen the most recent update?

00:11:19.629 --> 00:11:20.979
Are you excited for this new season?

00:11:20.979 --> 00:11:23.661
Whereas, with normal conversation,

00:11:23.661 --> 00:11:26.912
it's, it's painful sometimes
to kind of do the small talk.

00:11:26.912 --> 00:11:29.797
That's kind of like the
good part of cosplay for me.

00:11:29.797 --> 00:11:30.801
(contestants giggling)

00:11:30.801 --> 00:11:31.634
- Whoa, the grabbies.

00:11:31.634 --> 00:11:32.641
- A little stacky stack here.

00:11:32.641 --> 00:11:36.127
(contestants cheering)

00:11:36.127 --> 00:11:36.960
- Wee.

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:37.982
- You get a dollar, you get
a dollar, you get a dollar.

00:11:37.982 --> 00:11:38.896
- Fan, fan.

00:11:38.896 --> 00:11:39.729
(contestants laughing)

